@@ -0,0 +1,35 @@
+## Summary
+
+Describe the user-visible problem and the completed change.
+
+## Repository boundary
+
+- [ ] The change belongs in the required audio runtime, not only the browser
+      controller.
+- [ ] Companion-repository behavior remains compatible or is documented.
+
+## Tests
+
+List automated and manual checks:
+
+```text
+commands and results
+```
+
+## Audio/device impact
+
+Describe changes to capture devices, output devices, stream format, routing,
+latency, buffer size, CPU, network payload, or launchd behavior. Write `None`
+when unaffected.
+
+## Privacy
+
+- [ ] No personal IPs, usernames, paths, secrets, logs, or generated files
+- [ ] Logs and reproduction data are redacted
+- [ ] `pair.env` and rendered local configuration are not included
+
+## Licensing
+
+- [ ] GPL notices and upstream attribution remain intact
+- [ ] New third-party material is compatible with GPL-3.0-or-later and noted
+      where required
